    "body": "It's not clear to me whether a spec would be allowed to create a DOMException with a new error name (ie, not from that table) directly, without defining an interface that inherits from DOMException.\r\n\r\neg: Throw a \"SomeSpecSpecificError\" DOMException.\r\ninstead of: Throw a SpecError with some-error-code",
